    {
      "subject": "Alyosha",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Mitya",
      "quote": "“Yes, the trial’s to-morrow. Are you so hopeless, brother?” Alyosha said, with an apprehensive feeling.",
      "disputed": false,
